    "body": "## Motivation\r\n\r\n`test_flashinfer_dispatcher.py` has failed on main since #43363. That PR made the FlashInfer CUTLASS MoE runner read the disaggregation and schedule configs to size its autotune range, and updated the runner's own tests. This test still calls the runner without a published config, so every PR whose CPU partition includes it fails `base-a-test-cpu` (for example #43809):\r\n\r\n```\r\nERROR: test_cutlass_preserves_prefill_and_decode_combine_formats (prefill=True)\r\n  File \".../moe_runner/flashinfer_cutlass.py\", line 175, in _cutlass_moe_tune_max_num_tokens\r\n    if get_disagg().disaggregation_mode == \"decode\":\r\nValueError: config namespace 'disagg' not published\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Modifications\r\n\r\n- `test_cutlass_preserves_prefill_and_decode_combine_formats`: publish a default server config for the call with `get_context().override_server_args()`, as the runner's own tune-range tests in `test_flashinfer_cutlass_swiglu_params.py` do.\r\n- No change to non-test code.\r\n\r\n## Accuracy Tests\r\n\r\nNot applicable (test-only).\r\n\r\n`python3 test/registered/unit/layers/moe/test_flashinfer_dispatcher.py` with main at `306ccf6f57`: before, `FAILED (errors=2)` (both subtests, `config namespace 'disagg' not published`); after, `OK` (5 tests).\r\n\r\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\r\n\r\nNot applicable.\r\n\r\n## Checklist\r\n\r\n- [x] Format your code according to the [Format code with pre-commit](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#format-code-with-pre-commit).\r\n- [x] Add unit tests according to the [Run and add unit tests](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#run-and-add-unit-tests). (fixes an existing test)\r\n- [ ] Update documentation according to [Write documentations](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#write-documentations).\r\n- [ ] Provide accuracy and speed benchmark results according to [Test the accuracy](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#test-the-accuracy) and [Benchmark the speed](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#benchmark-the-speed).\r\n- [x] Follow the SGLang code style [guidance](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#code-style-guidance).\r\n\r\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\r\n---\r\n### CI States\r\n\r\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #39407133298](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39407133298)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\r\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #39407133430](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39407133430)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\r\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #39407133628](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39407133628)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\r\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
